<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results from the Swiss indoor tennis championships on Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Marc Goellner (Germany) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4  </p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 4-6</p>
<p>7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
